msgctxt "mission/multi/enemy_retreat"
msgid "They are retreating! We’ve held the line! Good work!"
msgstr "놈들이 후퇴한다! 전선을 지켜냈다! 잘했다!"

msgctxt "mission/multi/enemy_retreat2"
msgid "We have won! They're running away!"
msgstr "우리가 이겼다! 놈들이 도망친다!"
